## Weyland-Yutani corporate structure

cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-management = The Corporate Liaison and corporate management
cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-division-manager = The Division Manager
cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-chief-executive = The Chief Executive
cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-directorate = The Weyland-Yutani Directorate
cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-legal = The Legal Supervisor
cmu-job-supervisors-lead-researcher = The Lead Researcher

cmu-job-name-corporate-executive = Corporate Executive
cmu-job-description-corporate-executive = Do the company's paperwork. File reports, process requests and work your way up the corporate ladder.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-executive = Corp. Exec.

cmu-job-name-corporate-division-manager = Division Manager
cmu-job-description-corporate-division-manager = Run the company's site on the colony. You claim the division the site works for, and you answer to the sector's Chief Executive.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-division-manager = Div. Mng.

cmu-job-name-corporate-chief-executive = Chief Executive
cmu-job-description-corporate-chief-executive = Oversee every company site in the sector. The Division Manager runs this one day to day; you answer to the Directorate.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-chief-executive = Chief Exec.

cmu-job-name-corporate-legal-specialist = Legal Specialist
cmu-job-description-corporate-legal-specialist = Protect the company from liability. Draft contracts, review agreements and keep corporate staff within the law.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-legal-specialist = L. Spc.

cmu-job-name-corporate-legal-supervisor = Legal Supervisor
cmu-job-description-corporate-legal-supervisor = Lead corporate legal. Sign off on contracts and advise management on the company's legal standing.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-legal-supervisor = L. Spvsr.

cmu-job-name-corporate-lead-researcher = Lead Researcher
cmu-job-description-corporate-lead-researcher = Head the corporate science team. Direct research and report findings to corporate management.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-lead-researcher = Lead Res.

## Corporate security

cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-security-sergeant = The Corporate Security Sergeant
cmu-job-supervisors-corporate-ppc = The Personal Protection Coordinator

cmu-job-name-corporate-security-sergeant = Corporate Security Sergeant
cmu-job-description-corporate-security-sergeant = Lead corporate security. Assign your officers, protect company assets and answer to corporate management.
cmu-job-prefix-corporate-security-sergeant = CSSgt.

cmu-job-name-personal-protection = Personal Protection Officer
cmu-job-description-personal-protection = Keep the Chief Executive alive. Stay close, stay sharp and stay out of the way until you're needed.
cmu-job-prefix-personal-protection = PPO.

cmu-job-name-personal-protection-coordinator = Personal Protection Coordinator
cmu-job-description-personal-protection-coordinator = Lead the Chief Executive's protection detail. Plan routes, assign officers and decide when to pull your principal out.
cmu-job-prefix-personal-protection-coordinator = PPC.

